{"in":{"id":14,"delta":[{"path":["agents",0,"turns"],"set":[{"id":"2ef5093d-991c-49ae-bd2d-e349dff16cba","kind":"input","outcome":"completed","declared":"final","ending":"all_done","startedAt":1792456187243,"endedAt":1792456187535},{"id":"8c829f15-8211-449e-81ca-7a553d63ea5e","kind":"input","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456529640,"endedAt":1792456529708},{"id":"adbd4839-22c3-4b6b-9457-5e5fe6124cba","kind":"nudge","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456529716,"endedAt":1792456529732},{"id":"e0c7adde-d971-4d7f-8f87-c3922a5a39aa","kind":"nudge","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456529732,"endedAt":1792456529744},{"id":"e9ff882c-3e72-41c5-935f-65152795dd40","kind":"input","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456549309,"endedAt":1792456549312},{"id":"8d85b769-a122-45f6-ba7b-b2a55d345eac","kind":"nudge","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456549313,"endedAt":1792456549314},{"id":"5dacdc31-3d7f-4ddc-85b2-ea0e6710d222","kind":"nudge","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456549315,"endedAt":1792456549315}]},{"path":["agents",0,"since"],"remove":true},{"path":["messages"],"key":["seq","outgoing"],"put":{"seq":6,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456549.316000","authorKind":"ember","author":"ember","authorName":"still.fail","text":"⚠️ 本轮 agent 未在对话中回复，以下是它最后输出的文字，由 station 代为转发（并非它发布的消息）；回复即可继续：\n\n> Your turn ended without a state, so nobody knows where the chat stands. Only a real unresolved need requires need_human. A factual answer alone does not need a follow-up question; do not invent one. If you still need something after answering a clarification, visibly ask for it; need alone is only a status summary. Cards are optional. Do not reopen a decision the user already made. Decide whether anything in it is still unfinished, then end the turn with exactly one:\n> - all_done: nothing in the chat is left unfinished at all. Post the result with chat_post kind \"all_done\" (or chat_state \"all_done\" if you already posted it), with done: why nothing is left, naming the evidence (a commit, a release, a person's confirmation, the answer given).\n> - need_human: a person has to give, do, decide, confirm or verify something (a card you posted included), or answer a question you asked: kind \"need_human\" with need, what they have to give, do or decide (to verify: where, how and what to look at). If work you started is pending too, mention it after the ask in need.\n> - waiting: only work you started that will bring you back on its own (a background command or agent, a job, a loop watching CI), with nothing asked of anyone, and nothing else you can do meanwhile: chat_state \"waiting\" with seconds, your estimate of how long until it does, and for, what you wait for. Waiting on a person is need_human.\n> - Otherwise: continue the work.","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456549316,"mine":false,"system":true,"reportable":true,"by":{"name":"still.fail"},"waiting":false,"said":true,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456549316,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/20 08:35:49","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},"before":null},{"path":["messages"],"key":["seq","outgoing"],"put":{"outgoing":"out-58db944c905955914b","seq":5,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456549.307000","authorKind":"person","author":"alice@example.test","authorName":"Name of alice","text":"一段短的粘贴文字，来自剪贴板 082947","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456549307,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Name of alice","picture":"https://example.test/p.png"},"waiting":false,"said":true,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456549307,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/20 08:35:49","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},"before":[6,null]},{"path":["outbox"],"key":["id"],"drop":"out-58db944c905955914b"}]},"w":1792456549451.397}
